<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: TENNIS-CZECH OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CZECH OPEN FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>KARLOVY VARY, Czech Republic 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round</p>
<p>results in Czech Open women's tennis tournament on Tuesday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Karina Habsudova (Slovakia) beat Andrea Glass (Germany) 6-4</p>
<p>7-6 (7-1)</p>
<p>Patty Schnyder (Switzerland) beat Maria Sanchez Lorenzo (Spain)</p>
<p>6-3 4-6 6-1</p>
<p>Radka Bobkova (Czech Republic) beat Mariana Diaz Oliva</p>
<p>(Argentina) 4-6 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Lenka Cenkova (Czech Republic) beat Leila Meskhi (Georgia) 6-1</p>
<p>6-0</p>
<p>Katarzyna Nowak (Poland) beat Veronika Martinek (Germany) 6-2</p>
<p>2-6 6-3</p>
<p>8-Henrietta Nagyova (Slovakia) beat Cristin Torrens-Valero</p>
<p>(Spain) 4-6 7-5 6-4</p>
<p>7-Sabine Hack (Germany) beat Katerina Kroupova (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>6-3 6-3</p>
<p>Sandra Dopfer (Austria) beat Petra Langrova (Czech Republic)</p>
<p>6-2 6-4</p>
<p>5-Ruxandra Dragomir (Romania) beat Sarah Pitowski (France) 6-7</p>
<p>(5-7) 6-4 6-3</p>
<p>Silvia Talaja (Croatia) beat Bettina Fulco-Villella (Argentina)</p>
<p>6-1 6-3</p>
</text>
